IBMPlexSans-400-latin.woff2, IBMPlexSans-500-latin.woff2 and IBMPlexSans-600-latin.woff2
are IBM Plex Sans (https://github.com/IBM/plex), Copyright 2019 IBM Corp., licensed under
the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, a copy of which sits beside this file.

Taken unmodified from the npm package @fontsource/ibm-plex-sans@5.3.0
(files/ibm-plex-sans-latin-{400,500,600}-normal.woff2). The
ibm-plex-sans-cyrillic-{400,500,600}-normal.woff2 files come unmodified from the same package.

The plugin build inlines them into the studio's sheet as @font-face rules
(tools/system-sheet.mts); they draw the studio's chrome in the Sumi system.
